   `make asan`, or a stale ASan-instrumented binary silently breaks valgrind's own
   instrumentation with no visible error (bit this project once already). Safe
   sequence: `make clean && make CC=clang test && make CC=clang asan && make clean && make memcheck`.
6. **New-code color-read audit**: before finishing, grep the new code for `->color`
   and confirm every read (not proven-non-NULL write) goes through `color_of`.

## Verification

- `make clean && make CC=clang test`
- `make CC=clang asan`
- `make clean && make CC=clang memcheck` (fresh build, per Risk 5)
- All three green, plus all new `rb_validate`-based fixup tests and all unmodified
  Milestone 1 tests passing, before this milestone is considered done.

